          "date": "2026-11-08 03:37:03.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-20690 tests: skip EC create llapi tests in 27D interop",
        "message": "LU-20690 tests: skip EC create llapi tests in 27D interop\n\nllapi_layout_test test55 and test60 create EC files, which are now\nstored as LOV_PATTERN_PARITY. A pre-v2_17_52-42-gf1b7ae0cc6 MDS\ndoes not support that pattern, so file creation fails with EINVAL\nand sanity test_27D fails against b2_15 and b2_16 servers.\n\nSkip test55 and test60 with such a server, as is already done for\nthe other llapi tests that create EC files.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity env=ONLY=27D serverversion=2.16\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity env=ONLY=27D serverversion=2.15\nSigned-off-by: Keguang Xu <kxu@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: Cursor:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I362602ece6cff3705c1324a7c4218695989bee6c\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
